  <h2>Notes</h2>
  <p>This could be useful in vehicles where the source of thrust is important, such as a rocket or an air ship. Most vehicles do not need to change this value from the default.</p>
  <p>In rockets using this offset gives that very distinctive spiraling out of control.</p>
